Error [E0205]: Cannot take a write window through `View`<U8> — it has read access only
  --> tests/ui/view_subrange_read_only_write.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     window :: &bytes[0..<1]
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `View<T>` may inspect its owner's elements, but it cannot change them
 Fix: Take the write window from a `ViewMut<T>` or from the mutable owner instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
